put(595, 'Security assurance. Extend verification of existing session, workspace, per-window native permissions, service credentials and signed-device-command controls. Exercise account switching, grant revocation, hostile input, replay protection, expiry and UAC denial/approval in the packaged product; source existence alone is not enterprise assurance.')
