put(597, 'Model quality and training. Expand temporal/domain-held-out evaluation, measure false positives on legitimate login and shared-hosting sites, and isolate training from inference with durable jobs and controlled model promotion. User feedback should enter a reviewed labelled dataset; automatic online retraining is not currently implemented and should not ingest untrusted feedback unchecked.')
put(598, 'Action and integration scope. Extend the supported, approved device-action workflow with verified rollback before enabling broader guarded automatic response. Complete the planned AI CLI and MCP operation families only when their permission, evidence, cancellation and recovery contracts are implemented. Current queued/delivered receipts must remain distinct from applied outcomes.')
put(600, 'Future research should run longer deployments with raw measurement logs, compare agent ablations, test current models on independent regional and hosted-phishing corpora, and evaluate explanation quality with a defined blinded protocol. Product work includes isolated training, richer grounded AI CLI operations, broader MCP transports/tools, packaged mobile/native-capture acceptance and optional integration with a genuine dynamic-execution sandbox. The existing companion and limited stdio MCP/CLI source should not be described as either wholly absent or fully complete.')

